<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Sorry My Love Shadma</title>

<style>

body{
margin:0;
font-family: "Georgia", serif;
color:white;
text-align:center;
background: linear-gradient(135deg,#ff758c,#ff7eb3,#ffb199);
background-size:400% 400%;
animation: bgmove 12s infinite alternate;
}

@keyframes bgmove{
0%{background-position:left;}
100%{background-position:right;}
}

.container{
width:80%;
margin:auto;
padding:40px;
}

.page{
margin:60px 0;
padding:40px;
background:rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
border-radius:20px;
backdrop-filter:blur(6px);
box-shadow:0 0 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
animation: fadein 3s;
}

h1{
font-size:42px;
margin-bottom:20px;
}

p{
font-size:21px;
font-style:italic;
line-height:1.9;
}

@keyframes fadein{
from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px);}
to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}
}

/* floating hearts */

.heart{
position:fixed;
bottom:-10px;
font-size:20px;
animation: float 8s linear infinite;
}

@keyframes float{
0%{transform:translateY(0) scale(1);opacity:1;}
100%{transform:translateY(-100vh) scale(1.5);opacity:0;}
}

button{
margin-top:30px;
padding:15px 30px;
font-size:18px;
border:none;
border-radius:30px;
background:white;
color:#ff4b6e;
cursor:pointer;
transition:0.3s;
}

button:hover{
transform:scale(1.1);
}

</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

<div class="page">
<h1>My Dearest Shadma</h1>

<p>
Shadma, my love…  
From the deepest place in my heart, I want to say I am truly sorry.
</p>

<p>
Hurting you was never my intention.  
You are the most beautiful part of my life, and seeing you upset breaks my heart.
</p>

<p>
If I could take away your sadness and replace it with a thousand smiles, I would do it instantly.
Because your happiness means everything to me, Shadma.
</p>
</div>

<div class="page">
<h1>Apology Poetry For You</h1>

<p>
Shadma, the stars shine brighter when you smile,  
Your love makes every moment worthwhile.
</p>

<p>
If my words caused tears in your eyes,  
I promise to replace them with endless skies.
</p>

<p>
Without you, my world feels incomplete,  
Your love makes my life perfectly sweet.
</p>

<p>
Forgive my mistake, hold my hand again,  
Let our love grow stronger beyond this pain.
</p>
</div>

<div class="page">
<h1>From My Heart To Yours</h1>

<p>
Shadma, you are not just someone special to me.  
You are my happiness, my peace, and my favorite person in the world.
</p>

<p>
I promise to be more careful with your heart, because your heart is the most precious gift I have.
</p>

<p>
Please forgive me, Shadma.  
Let's turn this moment into another beautiful memory in our love story.
</p>

<p>
Forever loving you ❤️
</p>

<button onclick="alert('I Love You Shadma ❤️ Please Forgive Me')">
Forgive Me Shadma
</button>

</div>

</div>

<script>

function createHeart(){
const heart=document.createElement("div");
heart.classList.add("heart");
heart.innerHTML="❤";
heart.style.left=Math.random()*100+"vw";
heart.style.fontSize=Math.random()*20+10+"px";
heart.style.animationDuration=Math.random()*5+5+"s";
document.body.appendChild(heart);

setTimeout(()=>{
heart.remove();
},8000);
}

setInterval(createHeart,500);

</script>

</body>
</html>
